&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryNPRProdutor DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryNPRProdutor :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    open query {&queryName} for each {&tableName} no-lock
                               where {&tablename}.cdn-produt-rural = i-produtor.
    return "OK":U. 

END PROCEDURE.

